7d291f8f91da"],

Cell["\<\
I need a better summary notebook laying out the models for acute/chronic \
bistability as I start wanting to actually write a paper on all of this!

The NIH grant included these two models. The first is a model with \
immune-mediated feedbacks causing bistability. This model is a simplification \
of the model in Yates et al. 2000. Andy\[CloseCurlyQuote]s model was looking \
at Th1-Th2 feedbacks, specifically, but also included activation-induced cell \
death. The version I have included here is a much-simplified version of that \
model that basically only includes two key processes necessary to produce \
bistability: auto-stimulation (which would come about through cytokine-T cell \
positive feedback) and activation-induced cell death.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.796047273641008*^9, 3.7960473583758287`*^9}, {
  3.796047392632661*^9, 3.79604745432719*^9}, {3.796047724260281*^9, 
