Cell["\<\
Actually, I don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t even think you need a Type III response \
for this. You could get it with a Type II response as well.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.796071153298213*^9, 3.7960711705784492`*^9}, {
   3.796071216445409*^9, 3.796071237380978*^9}, 
