Cell[TextData[{
 "Assumptions underlying these parameter choices can be found in Ed\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s paper, but here are the parameters. The key biological \
points that Ed makes that would be relevant for a simplified model are:\n- \
early TF production is CY-independent and symmetric\n- Hill exponents = 2 for \
processes that are observed to have switch-like behavior, such as TF \
self-regulation/self-promotion in the absence of CY\n- blocking a TF1/2 \
promoter reduces TF1/2 production more than it enhance TF2/1 production\n- \
Hill exponents = 1 for processes that are observed to change gradually, such \
as CY promotion/inhibition of TF production and TF promotion/inhibition of CY \
production\n- CY promotion of TF is much stronger than CY inhibition of TF \
production, CY2 inhibition of TF1 is stronger than CY1 inhibition of TF2\n- \
TF-driven CY expression is invoked long after TF-driven TF expression has \
reached steady state\n- CY1 and CY2 production rates are both more impacted \
by TF2 than TF1\n\nThe other key point is that there are a few quantities \
that depend on \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]cell-volume of extracellular space \
[cvpc]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. This is because TF are measured on a per-cell \
basis, whereas secreted cytokines are measured on a concentration basis \
(e.g., ng/mL), so Ed had to figure out a conversion. He defined concentration \
to be the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]number of cytokine molecules per cell-volume \
of extracellular space.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] Given the known molecular \
weight of a cytokine and the known volume of a Th cell, the number of \
cytokine molecules per cell-volume of extracellular space is easily converted \
to ng/mL. The key here is that cell ",
 StyleBox["density",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " controls the ratio of the volume occupied by cells to the total volume \
including extracellular space, which he calls the packing efficiency (packing \
efficiency = cell density * cellular volume). He then converts packing \
efficiency into the number of cell-volumes of extracellular space ",
 StyleBox["per",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " Th cell (cvpc = (1-packing efficiency)/(packing efficiency). The higher \
the cvpc, the lower the secretion and removal rate of cytokines.\n\nThus, one \
thing that is worth looking at is how cytokine secretion changes with cell \
density. If cell density is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", "6"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "ad719c21-118b-4c32-8c6f-bc3de28cb337"],
 " Th cells/mL, and cell volume is 180 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]m", "3"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "7d98fb1d-ad60-4986-9a44-b2f23eeb6cc8"],
 " = 180 ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]m", "3"], "/", 
     SuperscriptBox["10", "12"]}], " ", 
    RowBox[{
     SuperscriptBox["\[Mu]m", "3"], "/", "mL"}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "4b809cfe-68a3-47d0-806b-d06da49a5aa0"],
 " = 1.8 x ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "10"}]], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "989813be-e770-4625-9904-e646a9992a3e"],
 " mL, then cpvc = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"1", "-", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["10", "6"], " ", "1.8", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["10", 
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}]}], 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["10", "6"], " ", "1.8", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["10", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}]], "=", "5554.56"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "a5c00798-5a01-4618-803f-3cf066953aae"],
 "; if cell density is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", "9"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->"TraditionalForm",ExpressionUUID->
  "9a303e07-19cf-4aef-979a-8c17a3fb6854"],
 " cells/mL, then cpvc = ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox[
     RowBox[{"1", "-", 
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox["10", "9"], " ", "1.8", " ", 
       SuperscriptBox["10", 
        RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}]}], 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox["10", "9"], " ", "1.8", " ", 
      SuperscriptBox["10", 
       RowBox[{"-", "10"}]]}]], "=", "4.56"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"5f8763bb-1402-4dab-85be-fc2a8fdef14a"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.79607324292031*^9, 3.7960732704685907`*^9}, {
  3.7960733028307123`*^9, 3.796073314797328*^9}, {3.7961217176216307`*^9, 
  3.796121886191547*^9}, {3.796121924453176*^9, 3.796122026727046*^9}, {
