Cell["\<\
We can use simulation of these models to get some sense of how long it takes \
for cytokine secretion to come to an equilibrium at different cell densities. 

At low cell density, it takes quite a long time - thousands of hours.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.796131278362303*^9, 3.796131303989958*^9}, {
  3.79613178347795*^9, 
  3.796131806922633*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3c15c210-e142-461f-b121-\
4217c63074b7"],

