Cell["\<\
The first thing to look at is to compare the timecourses of TF and CY \
expression without and with APCs. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s do it for a fairly \
high cell density (cd = 1e8)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.796639654738325*^9, 
  3.796639724949898*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a7f6bd65-7770-490b-9fa5-\
58e9ba582234"],

