Cell["\<\
You can see that the addition of APCs (both Type 1 and Type 2) makes a \
co-expression equilibrium much more likely. Without APCs, the equilibrium is \
Th2 polarized. Now it is much more balanced between the two - the expression \
of TF2 > TF1, but TF1 >> 0 now.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.796639960559457*^9, 
  3.796640040231958*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"31435f53-ef51-4c75-aaf9-\
2ae1198e25ad"],

